# SCPN Beam Target Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Beam Target Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the beam-target and colliding-beam
  fusion configurations within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group.
  Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated device
  configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN
  Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0 device physics (the
  published cross-section fit of the light-ion reactions at the energy a
  declared configuration presents to a target at rest, and what a declared
  beam current and energy amount to), and tessellated and B-rep models of a
  beam line and what it fires into. All parameter sets are synthetic; no
  real machine is described, and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
